  "sozler_html": "<p>Şu garip halimden\nbilen işveli nazlım<br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Göynüm hep seni arıyor neredesin sen</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Tatlı dillim güler yüzlüm ey caylan gözlüm</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Göynüm hep seni arıyor neredesin sen</span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Ben ağlarsam ağlayıp gülersem gülen</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Bütün dertlerimi anlayıp göynümü bilen</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Sanki kalbimi bilerek yüzüme gülen</span><br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Göynüm hep seni arıyor neredesin sen</span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-si